<meta name="description" content="Surya designs and builds fast, clean websites for businesses. Written by a C programmer, so the code is as tidy as the design.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500;700;800&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#work">Skip to work</a>
<header class="top">
  <a class="logo" href="#">Surya</a>
  <button class="menu" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button>
  <nav id="nav">
    <a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#process">Process</a><a href="#about">About</a>
    <a class="btn small" href="#contact">Hire me</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <h1>Websites built with the discipline of low-level code.</h1>
    <p class="lead">I design and build fast, clear websites that make your business look as good as it works. Every page is hand-coded: no bloated templates, no wasted bytes.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn" href="#contact">Start a project</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#work">See my work</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="term" aria-label="C code that builds your website">
    <div class="term-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>site.c</span></div>
    <pre id="code" aria-live="off"></pre>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats" aria-label="Quality targets">
  <p><b>&lt; 1s</b> load time target on every page</p>
  <p><b>100%</b> responsive: phone, tablet, desktop</p>
  <p><b>0</b> templates or page-builder bloat</p>
  <p><b>AA</b> accessible contrast and keyboard use</p>
</section>

<section id="work" class="work">
  <h2>Selected work</h2>
  <p class="sub">Replace these three with your real projects: screenshot, one-line result, link.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#" class="proj">
      <div class="thumb t1"><span>Fitness studio</span></div>
      <div><h3>IronWorks Gym website</h3><p>Class timetable, membership plans and online booking. Mobile sign-ups up after launch.</p><small>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</small></div>
    </a></li>
    <li><a href="#" class="proj">
      <div class="thumb t2"><span>Local business</span></div>
      <div><h3>Sharma Sweets storefront</h3><p>Menu, gallery and WhatsApp ordering in a single fast page.</p><small>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</small></div>
    </a></li>
    <li><a href="#" class="proj">
      <div class="thumb t3"><span>Developer tool</span></div>
      <div><h3>C Notes documentation site</h3><p>Searchable reference with syntax highlighting and dark mode.</p><small>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</small></div>
    </a></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="process" class="process">
  <h2>How a project runs</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><h3>Brief</h3><p>A short call to learn your goals, audience and deadline. You get a fixed quote.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Design</h3><p>Layout and style preview before any code. Two rounds of changes included.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Build</h3><p>Hand-coded, tested on real phones and browsers, and checked for speed.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Launch</h3><p>I publish it, hand over the files and stay on for 30 days of free fixes.</p></li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="photo"><img src="images/surya.jpg" alt="Surya watching the sunset by the sea" onerror="this.parentNode.classList.add('empty')"></div>
  <div>
    <h2>Hi, I'm Surya</h2>
    <p>I'm a C programmer who designs websites. C taught me to care about every byte and every edge case, and that is why my sites load quickly and don't break.</p>
    <p>Outside of code I train at the gym. Lifting taught me that progress comes from showing up, repeating the basics and finishing every set. I bring the same habit to client work: clear updates and delivery on the date I promise.</p>
    <ul class="skills"><li>HTML5</li><li>CSS3</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>C</li><li>Responsive design</li><li>SEO basics</li><li>Git</li></ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
  <h2>Tell me about your project</h2>
  <p class="sub">I reply within one working day.</p>
  <form id="form" novalidate>
    <label>Your name<input name="name" required autocomplete="name"></label>
    <label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email"></label>
    <label class="full">What do you need?<textarea name="msg" rows="4" required></textarea></label>
    <button class="btn" type="submit">Send message</button>
    <p id="status" role="status"></p>
  </form>
</section>
</main>

<footer><p>&copy; <span id="yr"></span> Surya. Designed and coded by hand.</p></footer>
<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
